# MCP integration profile

This project was generated with the `mcp` integration profile.

The local MCP server is `mcp/server.mjs` and uses stdio transport. It exposes
only read-only project status, deterministic preflight, and release readiness.
It does not publish tags or GitHub Releases automatically.

The shared repository checkers and release gate remain authoritative. Any
non-zero checker status is returned as an MCP error.
